    "selection": "Public repositories chosen by the harness author to cover agent frameworks in six languages, MCP servers and client configurations, coding-agent configuration files, skills, A2A cards, low-code exports, IaC, provider SDKs, and hard negatives whose names collide with AI products. Not a random sample. Two candidates were excluded for size (openclaw/openclaw at 52k files and the mastra monorepo at 20k files).",
